      "message": "I\u0027ve not joined the dots with the code that uses this yet, but is the intermediate hop of the `RequestPacket` needed?  If every place that calls `serialize_to_packet()` immediately follows it with a call to `RequestPacket::serialize_to_bytes()` then maybe drop the `Packet` structure and have a `serialize_to_bytes()` method here instead.",
