      "message": "It is required on the receiver end. The fact that all received requests deserialize to `RequestPacket`, enable receiver to:\n1) Accept bytes\n2) Deserialize the bytes -\u003e RequestPacket\n3) RequestPacket::get_opcode(\u0026packet) \u0026\n4) accordingly deserialize it to appropriate Request (like `GetVersionRequest`/`GetSecretRequest`)",
